    "detailed_description": "Get ready to be charmed and challenged in <strong>Swamped !</strong>, a tower defense adventure where cuteness meets strategy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/2e10b240e9b4e368bb5bcfb59cf9c161.avif?t=1726478429\" width=473 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/12edddb552cf2c963ded8e9b65d42d21.poster.avif?t=1726478429\" width=524 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/12edddb552cf2c963ded8e9b65d42d21.webm?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/12edddb552cf2c963ded8e9b65d42d21.mp4?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from a wide array of quirky towers, each with unique abilities. Strategically place them along the path to unleash adorable chaos on your foes!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/ee6692809f35fb240b863d945280992a.avif?t=1726478429\" width=553 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/366d7c96e8e1a1944114ab5f320c9f0a.poster.avif?t=1726478429\" width=526 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/366d7c96e8e1a1944114ab5f320c9f0a.webm?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/366d7c96e8e1a1944114ab5f320c9f0a.mp4?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover rare items, powerful artifacts, and enchanting hats that will make your heroes unstoppable.<br>Improve Your Character: Gain experience and level up your heroes to unlock new skills and abilities. Watch them evolve from scrappy recruits to legendary defenders.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/83f55a2a7389a4d54a6f7fbe9b0d1d24.avif?t=1726478429\" width=553 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/d201ce5a1caf8fb8d1e66a37afcea45d.poster.avif?t=1726478429\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/d201ce5a1caf8fb8d1e66a37afcea45d.webm?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/d201ce5a1caf8fb8d1e66a37afcea45d.mp4?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Journey through lush forests, whimsical meadows, and mysterious caves as you face a variety of adorable foes. Each level presents new challenges and rewards, so gather your wits and your cutest defenders to conquer them all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Adorable visuals: Immerse yourself in a world overflowing with charm and cuteness.<br></li><li>Strategic tower defense gameplay: Plan your defenses carefully to outsmart your enemies.<br></li><li>RPG progression: Level up your heroes, unlock skills, and equip them with powerful gear.<br></li><li>Tons of loot: Discover rare items, funny hats, and magical equipment to customize your character.<br></li><li>Whether you're a seasoned tower defense veteran or a newcomer to the genre, Swamped will captivate you with its delightful world, strategic challenges, and heartwarming characters. Are you ready to defend the cutest realm ever known?</li></ul><br>Join the fun and start your Swamped adventure today!",
    "about_the_game": "Get ready to be charmed and challenged in <strong>Swamped !</strong>, a tower defense adventure where cuteness meets strategy!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/2e10b240e9b4e368bb5bcfb59cf9c161.avif?t=1726478429\" width=473 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/12edddb552cf2c963ded8e9b65d42d21.poster.avif?t=1726478429\" width=524 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/12edddb552cf2c963ded8e9b65d42d21.webm?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/12edddb552cf2c963ded8e9b65d42d21.mp4?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Choose from a wide array of quirky towers, each with unique abilities. Strategically place them along the path to unleash adorable chaos on your foes!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/ee6692809f35fb240b863d945280992a.avif?t=1726478429\" width=553 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/366d7c96e8e1a1944114ab5f320c9f0a.poster.avif?t=1726478429\" width=526 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/366d7c96e8e1a1944114ab5f320c9f0a.webm?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/366d7c96e8e1a1944114ab5f320c9f0a.mp4?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Discover rare items, powerful artifacts, and enchanting hats that will make your heroes unstoppable.<br>Improve Your Character: Gain experience and level up your heroes to unlock new skills and abilities. Watch them evolve from scrappy recruits to legendary defenders.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/83f55a2a7389a4d54a6f7fbe9b0d1d24.avif?t=1726478429\" width=553 height=70 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/d201ce5a1caf8fb8d1e66a37afcea45d.poster.avif?t=1726478429\" width=634 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/d201ce5a1caf8fb8d1e66a37afcea45d.webm?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3058430/extras/d201ce5a1caf8fb8d1e66a37afcea45d.mp4?t=1726478429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Journey through lush forests, whimsical meadows, and mysterious caves as you face a variety of adorable foes. Each level presents new challenges and rewards, so gather your wits and your cutest defenders to conquer them all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>key Features:</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Adorable visuals: Immerse yourself in a world overflowing with charm and cuteness.<br></li><li>Strategic tower defense gameplay: Plan your defenses carefully to outsmart your enemies.<br></li><li>RPG progression: Level up your heroes, unlock skills, and equip them with powerful gear.<br></li><li>Tons of loot: Discover rare items, funny hats, and magical equipment to customize your character.<br></li><li>Whether you're a seasoned tower defense veteran or a newcomer to the genre, Swamped will captivate you with its delightful world, strategic challenges, and heartwarming characters. Are you ready to defend the cutest realm ever known?</li></ul><br>Join the fun and start your Swamped adventure today!",
